  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Located in the heart of WaterColor's Park District, Izzy B is a stunning seven-bedroom retreat accommodating up to 16 guests. This elegant coastal estate features a private saltwater pool, carriage house, and 6 adult bikes. Just one block from the Boathouse Pool and a short walk to Seaside, this home offers the ideal combination of luxury, comfort, and location for your 30A getaway.<br><br>Highlights<br>– Exclusive Access to the WaterColor Beach Club and Community Pools with Up to 16 Passes Included<br>– 6 Adult Cruiser Bikes Included in Rental<br>– Parking for 4 Vehicles (Garage Access Available)<br>– Private Saltwater Pool with Jacuzzi Jets (Complimentary Pool Heating Available October 1–May 1)<br>– One Block to the Boathouse Pool<br>– Gourmet Kitchen<br>– Outside Covered Patio and Balconies<br>– Exterior Shower<br>– Natural Gas Grill<br>– Surround Sound on Main Floor and Courtyard<br>– Private Entrance to Carriage House and Main House Connected by Courtyard with Wet Bar, Mini Fridge, and Ice Maker<br>– 2 Sets of Washers and Dryers<br>– 3-Minute Walk to the WaterColor Beach Club and Beach Access<br>– 3-Minute Bike Ride to Seaside Central Square<br><br>Izzy B at 209 Western Lake Drive combines coastal sophistication with family comfort in one of WaterColor's most desirable locations. The home's open-concept main level showcases oak flooring, shiplap walls, and rustic ceiling beams that enhance its timeless charm. The gourmet kitchen features Calcutta marble countertops, high-end appliances, a wine cooler, and a spacious island that serves as the centerpiece for gathering and entertaining. The adjacent dining area seats eight, complemented by comfortable living space and surround sound for relaxed evenings together.<br><br>Two king bedrooms on the first floor each include private baths, while the second-floor primary suite offers a private balcony, double vanity, steam shower, and soaking tub, along with an office and wet bar. Two additional bunk rooms, each sleeping four, include private bathrooms, and a convenient washer and dryer completes this level.<br><br>On the third floor, a media room with sectional seating and two full beds creates the perfect retreat for kids or teens.<br><br>The outdoor courtyard is a highlight, designed with Chicago brick and centered around a saltwater pool with waterfall and jacuzzi jets. Guests can relax poolside, prepare meals on the natural gas grill, or enjoy drinks from the outdoor wet bar. The attached carriage house provides additional privacy with its own kitchen, bedroom, and full bath—ideal for extended family or guests.<br><br>With six adult cruiser bikes included and a prime location just minutes from Seaside and the Beach Club, Izzy B delivers an unforgettable WaterColor experience that combines elegance, convenience, and coastal relaxation.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
