          {
            "date": "Jul 29, 2023",
            "id": "6c83cef5-78a3-42e1-980c-d05d1692c576",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Thank you for staying with us at Sanders Beach Rentals! We are so pleased to hear that you had a wonderful girl’s getaway at the lovely 209 Western Lake! The home truly is amazing and we are so glad you enjoyed the kitchen and the location of the home. Please keep us in the mind for your next beach vacation. We would love for you to stay with us again!",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "This home is stunning and was perfect for our annual family girls trip! It had plenty of space for all of us (14), and we really enjoyed the pool. The kitchen was incredible and allowed us all to spend time with each other around the island. \n\nIt was very close to everything, we had a great day on the beach as well. I would highly recommend this home. It really is beautiful!",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "title": "Gorgeous Home for Family Girls Trip",
        "verified": true
      },
      {
