            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "We are so delighted that you enjoyed your stay with us at this beautiful home! We agree that this home is in a great location and is great for the whole family to enjoy! So glad that you enjoyed all the the wonderful amenities of the home! We hope to hear from you when you are ready for another fabulous beach trip!",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "The best location as far as proximity to all the hot spots in Watercolor. Perfect for 3 families to share. Beautiful home. Huge Jacuzzi is more like a “spool”. Perfect if it’s cold out to heat up. We will be back!!!",
